                "text": "As of yesterday, Oregonians are paying more for their health insurance and SNAP benefits aren't going out.\n\nThat\u2019s not what putting the American people first looks like. I\u2019m calling on my Republican colleagues to come to the table and get a deal done to end this shutdown.",
