                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "People from across Oregon have been writing to my office concerned about their healthcare costs going up.\u00a0\n\nI'll continue fighting to reverse cuts in Republicans' trash budget and to make healthcare more accessible, not less. https://t.co/DTTpCnexdv",
