                "text": "Republicans want to make healthcare less affordable. We won\u2019t let that happen.\n\nI joined my colleagues in signing a petition to force a vote to lower costs. I won\u2019t leave Oregonians behind.\n\nhttps://t.co/5H8KlUBUZg",
