                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "The budget we voted on tonight did nothing to protect healthcare for Oregonians. Instead, it\u2019s going to raise costs, putting care out of reach for millions of Americans. I voted no. https://t.co/SDl3XYf4sg",
